    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value7" xlink:to="footnote7" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="7" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote8" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The Utility Plant (101-105, 114) total of $377,128,351 includes two operating lease/right of use (ROU) assets valued at $594,890 and $493,133. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating leases are recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value8" xlink:to="footnote8" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="8" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote9" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The $956,326 represents the non-current portion of the operating lease liability associated with two right of use (ROU) assets, $416,942 and $539,384. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease assets are recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value9" xlink:to="footnote9" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote10" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>The $219,280 represents the current portion of the operating lease liability associated with two right of use (ROU) assets, $191,785 and $27,495. Following guidance from Accounting Inquiries at FERC, and due to the absence of a specific FERC code for operating leases, the code for capital leases was utilized and the necessary footnotes were provided. The operating lease assets are recorded in account 101.1. The non-current portion of the liability is in account 227.0 and the current portion of the liability is in account 243.0.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
